{"ID":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3ab","id":"20260203094519-qxx8y9q","tags":"R-CNN框架,神经网络基础学习,目标检测","title":"R-CNN","type":"doc","updated":"20260207105542"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260207103030-6fkv4zy","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260207103030-6fkv4zy","updated":"20260207103423"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260207103039-f8992n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103039-f8992n6","updated":"20260207103302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"R-CNN的出现应该是一个比较历程杯意义的。"}]},{"ID":"20260207103310-wl8lxbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103310-wl8lxbc","updated":"20260207103310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前的人们主要做的事情是图像分类，无论是CNN的创始名著"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260201125229-m656ezj","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"LeNet-5"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、亦或是现阶段引用最多的文章"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260206192508-7vlgudd","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"ResNet"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他们做的均是图像分类，尤其是在ImageNet上进行的图像分类。"}]},{"ID":"20260207103302-za0vakw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103302-za0vakw","updated":"20260207103422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是，随着时代的逐步发展，单单进行图像分类这个事情已经不足以支撑后面的研究了，人们逐渐聚焦于一种新的事情-图像目标检测任务。这个任务应该就是R-CNN出现的目的。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207103423-9kgkp7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103423-9kgkp7y","updated":"20260207103507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260207103507-ihqsqa9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260203104217-ilxq3hp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260203104217-ilxq3hp","updated":"20260207103648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207103517-vptkrjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103517-vptkrjz","updated":"20260207103605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"R-CNN"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原文"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Rich feature hierarchies for accurate object detection and semantic segmentation Tech report (v5)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是Ross等人于2014年在CVPR中提出的全新的目标检测方法。"}]},{"ID":"20260207103633-ccifj56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103633-ccifj56","updated":"20260207103648"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"R-CNN 是计算机视觉历史上的一个关键转折点。它完成了从图像分类 到目标检测  的技术过渡。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207103536-qe9ez8v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260207103536-qe9ez8v","updated":"20260207103536"}},{"ID":"20260207103704-0qxlows","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260207103704-0qxlows","updated":"20260207105542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1 模型创作背景"}]},{"ID":"20260207103755-j96fl4i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103755-j96fl4i","updated":"20260207104032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里开始主要就是讨论目标检测相关的问题-"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"object detection"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然这个问题在多年前已经有过探究了，当时人们使用的方式非常简单，也很显著，那就是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"颜色阈值"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个方法当然有问题，但是在当时可以说是非常的好用毕竟自然界中很多不同类型的作物或者是生物他们的颜色各不相同。"}]},{"ID":"20260207105346-3rlj0ez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207105346-3rlj0ez","updated":"20260207105356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"height: 33vh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260207105325-mh297rc.png"},{"Type":"NodeLinkSpace"},{"Type":"NodeLinkTitle","Data":"基于颜色阈值的图像分割"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"height: 33vh\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260207104032-u287vnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207104032-u287vnn","updated":"20260207104155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是随着发展，人们意识到颜色已经不够看了，毕竟青菜、芹菜、白菜这些蔬菜他们的颜色也是相差不大的，用颜色阈值并不能完美实现要求。因此SFIT等表特征提取的算法就应运而生了。"}]},{"ID":"20260207104156-psj835h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207104156-psj835h","updated":"20260207104254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但是这些都是传统的算法，并没有将深度学习的想法进行融入，因此RCNN就是为了抛弃曾经的传统架构，想一个全新的基于卷积神经网络的算法在目标检测任务。"}]},{"ID":"20260207104254-jw3fxqp","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260207104254-jw3fxqp","updated":"20260207105428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20260207104255-atacmwe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207104255-atacmwe","updated":"20260207104319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当然CNN算法已经达到了一定的水平了，因此使用CNN也是情理之中。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260207105439-mq3alon","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207105439-mq3alon","updated":"20260207105505"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同时，这是深度学习领域首次将 CNN 卷积神经网络应用于目标检测任务。"}]},{"ID":"20260207105439-ighyh3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207105439-ighyh3m","updated":"20260207105542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在此之前，目标检测主要依赖传统的手工特征的提取方式，R-CNN首次 证明了可以使用 CNN 卷积神经网络进行提取的特征在检测任务上表现优异，奠定了现代目标检测算法的基础。"}]},{"ID":"20260207105408-472tfu1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260207105408-472tfu1","updated":"20260207105408"}},{"ID":"20260207103712-zf8mdej","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260207103712-zf8mdej","updated":"20260207103717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2 模型整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260207103717-8lfqba7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260207103717-8lfqba7","updated":"20260207103725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3 模型代码实现"}]},{"ID":"20260207103725-095ko4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260207103725-095ko4a","updated":"20260207103725"}}]}